{"format":"telly-addicts-eps","v":1,"show":"Noddy","i":64778,"eps":[{"s":1,"e":1,"t":"Noddy Goes to Toyland","a":"1975-03-24","l":15,"d":"In the very first episode - \"Noddy Goes to Toyland\" - Noddy doesn't actually have a name, or indeed, that blue hat with a bell on the end. He is encountered en route to Toytown - or more precisely - struck by Big Ears the Brownie on his bicycle after he encounters him in the middle of the Toytown road. The lad has run away from his Toymaker."},{"s":1,"e":2,"t":"Hurrah for Noddy","a":"1975-03-31","l":15,"d":"Noddy has to find a way to make money for himself as he settles into life in Toy Town. Will he find a job cleaning houses and washing cars? Or will his new car help him earn money?"},{"s":1,"e":3,"t":"Noddy and His Car","a":"1975-04-07","l":15},{"s":1,"e":4,"t":"Noddy Goes to School","a":"1975-04-14","l":15},{"s":1,"e":5,"t":"Noddy and the Bumpy Dog","a":"1975-04-21","l":15,"img":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/371205/episodes/5e8a251a014aa.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":6,"t":"Well Done, Noddy","a":"1975-04-28","l":15,"img":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/371205/episodes/5e8a253298f9f.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":7,"t":"Noddy at the Seaside","a":"1975-05-05","l":15,"img":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/371205/episodes/5e8a254de028d.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":8,"t":"Noddy Gets into Trouble","a":"1975-05-12","l":15},{"s":1,"e":9,"t":"Noddy and the Magic Rubber","a":"1975-05-19","l":15,"img":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/371205/episodes/5e8a25649fa57.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":10,"t":"Noddy and Tessie Bear","a":"1975-06-02","l":15},{"s":1,"e":11,"t":"Noddy and the Thief","a":"1975-06-09","l":15},{"s":1,"e":12,"t":"Noddy Be Brave","a":"1975-06-16","l":15},{"s":2,"e":1,"t":"You're a Good Friend, Noddy","a":"1975-09-22","l":15},{"s":2,"e":2,"t":"Here Comes Noddy Again","a":"1975-09-29","l":15},{"s":2,"e":3,"t":"You Funny Little Noddy","a":"1975-10-06","l":15},{"s":2,"e":4,"t":"Look Out, Noddy","a":"1975-10-13","l":15},{"s"